cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use oxide-sloc in your work, please cite it as below."
title: oxide-sloc
abstract: >-
  A Rust-based local code metrics workbench: IEEE 1045-1992 physical SLOC analysis, lexical
  unit-test detection, coverage import, COCOMO I estimation, approximate cyclomatic complexity,
  git hotspots, and per-author code ownership, with CLI, web UI, HTML/PDF reports, a REST API,
  and an MCP server for AI agents.
type: software
authors:
